ion.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="index-module-scss-module__hmBoNG__textMediaCardButtons"><div class="DualCTAs-module-scss-module__TvdWpW__dualCTAWrapper"><a class="BkButton-module-scss-module__b-zy-W__bkButton BkText-module-scss-module__lpxhIa__typeShortSm BkButton-module-scss-module__b-zy-W__stylePropsSm BkButton-module-scss-module__b-zy-W__medium BkButton-module-scss-module__b-zy-W__expandOnSm BkButton-module-scss-module__b-zy-W__primaryTheme BkButton-module-scss-module__b-zy-W__blackBtnTheme" element="button" href="https://www.airtable.com/platform/ai-agents" data-variant="primary" data-size="sm">Learn more</a></div></div></section></section></div><div><div style="background-image:url(https://cdn.sanity.io/images/hlcyrtq5/production/3385c0df6528302ab335b5c6344945583712d9df-2000x1600.png?w=1536)" class="BackgroundImageCard-module-scss-module__ewihwa__section TextMediaCard-module-scss-module__6l18Rq__textMediaCard BkGrid-module-scss-module__XUexzW__bkGrid BkGrid-module-scss-module__XUexzW__gap"><div class="Area-module-scss-module__j5XUDa__baseOneStart Area-module-scss-module__j5XUDa__baseTwelveEnd Area-module-scss-module__j5XUDa__mdOneStart Area-module-scss-module__j5XUDa__mdFiveEnd"><div class="BackgroundImageCard-module-scss-module__ewihwa__iconContainer"><div class="NextImage-module-scss-module__liCCiW__imageContainer" style="width:226px;height:226px"><img alt="media" loading="lazy" width="226" height="226" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="" style="color: transparent;" sizes="226px" srcset="https://cdn.sanity.io/images/hlcyrtq5/production/e1ae4b7878c18828b1817f51d0a7c214061d8a3d-1000x1000.gif?w=1536 32w, https://cdn.sanity.io/images/hlcyrtq5/production/e1ae4b7878c18828b1817f51d0a7c214061d8a3d-1000x1000.gif?w=1536 48w, https://cdn.sanity.io/images/hlcyrtq5/production/e1ae4b7878c18828b1817f51d0a7c214061d8a3d-1000x1000.gif?w=1536 64w, https://cdn.sanity.io/images/hlcyrtq5/production/e1ae4b7878c18828b1817f51d0a7c214061d8a3d-1000x1000.gif?w=1536 96w, 