e__j5XUDa__mdSevenStart Area-module-scss-module__j5XUDa__mdTwelveEnd" style="--icon-url:url(https://cdn.sanity.io/images/hlcyrtq5/production/0834b04934b4e12d875dd7b721f8ed6482676149-24x25.svg?w=1536);--list-heading-color:#214224;--list-description-color:#41454D"><div class="BkText-module-scss-module__lpxhIa__typeShortSmMd BkText-module-scss-module__lpxhIa__bkText BkText-module-scss-module__lpxhIa__normal BkType-module-scss-module__SLzQkq__bkType" style="color:#41454D;opacity:1"><div class="PortableTextBody-module__4x3unq__root"><p class="PortableTextBody-module__4x3unq__block"><strong class="font-semibold">Scalable infrastructure</strong></p><ul class="PortableTextBody-module__4x3unq__listBullet"><li class="PortableTextBody-module__4x3unq__listItem">HyperDB with record limits in the hundreds of millions</li><li class="PortableTextBody-module__4x3unq__listItem">Scale workflows to tens of thousands of users</li><li class="PortableTextBody-module__4x3unq__listItem">Use AI models from leading providers&nbsp; (OpenAI, Gemini, Llama, Anthropic, and more)</li></ul><p class="PortableTextBody-module__4x3unq__block"><strong class="font-semibold">Flexible administration</strong></p><ul class="PortableTextBody-module__4x3unq__listBullet"><li class="PortableTextBody-module__4x3unq__listItem">Admin roles, robust permissions, fine-grained RBAC</li><li class="PortableTextBody-module__4x3unq__listItem">Fine-grained controls to enable AI</li><li class="PortableTextBody-module__4x3unq__listItem">Programmatic provisioning and de-provisioning</li><li class="PortableTextBody-module__4x3unq__listItem">IDP synced groups</li></ul><p class="PortableTextBody-module__4x3unq__block"><strong class="font-semibold">Security and compliance</strong></p><ul class="PortableTextBody-module__4x3unq__listBullet"><li class="PortableTextBody-module__4x3unq__listItem">ISO, HIPAA, SOC 2</li><li class="PortableTextBody-module__4x3unq__listItem">No customer data retained or used to train AI models</li><li class="PortableTextBody-module__4x3unq__listItem">Models run fully in Airtable’s AWS environment</li><li class="PortableTextBody-module__4x3unq__listItem">EKM, data loss prevention, audit logs, e-discovery</li><li class="PortableTextBody-module__4x3unq__listItem">European and Australian data residency support</li></ul><p class="PortableTextBody-module__4x3unq__block"></p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></section></section></div><div class="w-full min-w-0"><section data-block="card-grid" data-layout="bento" class="CardGrid-module-scss-module__5N3nvG__bentoSection" style="--theme_background:#FFFFFF;--theme_text:#333840;background-color:var(--theme_background);color:var(--theme_text)"><div class="Wrapper-module-scss-module__mUjbMq__gridWrap Wrapper-module-scss-module__mUjbMq__gridWrapV2"><div class="HeadingGroup-module__HOCJpW__root" data-text-alignment="left" data-vertical-spacing="medium" data-has-cta="true"><div class="HeadingGroup-module__HOCJpW__textGroup"><h2 class="HeadingGroup-module__HOCJpW__heading">The path to 10x every person in your organization</h2><p class="HeadingGroup-module__HOCJpW__subheading">Use cases and templates to activate AI in your workflows</p></div><div class="HeadingGroup-module__HOCJpW__ctaWrap"><div class="DualCTAs-module-scss-module__TvdWpW__dualCTAWrapper"><a class="BkButton-module-scss-module__b-zy-W__bkButton BkText-module-scss-module__lpxhIa__typeShortSm BkButton-module-scss-module__b-zy-W__stylePropsSm BkButton-module-scss-module__b-zy-W__medium BkButton-module-scss-module__b-zy-W__expandOnSm BkButton-module-scss-module__b-zy-W__primaryTheme BkButton-module-scss-module__b-zy-W__blackBtnTheme" element="button" href="https://www.airtable.com/ai-plays" data-variant="primary" data-size="sm">See AI plays</a></div></div></div></div><section class="index-module-scss-module__3yd1LW__bentoBoxSectionWrapper"><section class=""><div class="Wrapper-module-scss-module__mUjbMq__gridWrap Wrapper-module-scss-module__mUjbMq__gridWr